OL,3,GNEWSACalls to relax 'Dickensian' Peak  
OL,4,ADistrict house-buying rules            
OL,6,FThere are calls for Peak District      
OL,7,Fbosses to relax what some locals have  
OL,8,Fcalled a "Dickensian" housing rule,    
OL,9,Fwhich they say is hampering efforts to 
OL,10,Fattract and keep young families living 
OL,11,Fand working in the area.               
OL,13,FA clause under the national park       
OL,14,Fauthority's legally binding planning   
OL,15,Frules dictates that prospective        
OL,16,Fresidents within many areas of the     
OL,17,Fnational park need a local connection  
OL,18,Fto the village going back a decade - or
OL,19,Fa decade within the past 20 years - in 
OL,20,Forder to access affordable housing     
OL,21,Fthere.                                 
