OL,3,GNEWSACalls to relax 'Dickensian' Peak  
OL,4,ADistrict house-buying rules            
OL,6,FSeveral local authorities are calling  
OL,7,Ffor the "restrictive" rule to be       
OL,8,Frelaxed amid concerns about sustaining 
OL,9,Fthe region's ageing population.        
OL,11,FThe park authority is now consulting on
OL,12,Fintroducing more flexibility to the    
OL,13,Frule.                                  
